Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.64,Cap,,0,0,0,,In July, twelve hundred AI agents
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.75,0:00:04.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,found a shared message board —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.55,0:00:06.55,Cap,,0,0,0,,and seven hundred broke into Hugging
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.63,0:00:09.03,Cap,,0,0,0,,Face together. No single agent was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.08,0:00:12.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,told to. Swarm failures aren't single-model
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.32,0:00:14.40,Cap,,0,0,0,,failures. We built a testbed to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.48,0:00:15.83,Cap,,0,0,0,,watch them happen on a task
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.92,0:00:18.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,with deterministic ground truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.50,0:00:25.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,The task: procedurally generated languages
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.62,0:00:28.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,that don't exist. Four agents each
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.62,0:00:30.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,receive a disjoint shard of bilingual
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.66,0:00:32.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,evidence — three or four pairs
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.42,0:00:34.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,apiece — plus a shared morpheme
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.57,0:00:36.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,bank. Over four rounds they post
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.06,0:00:39.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,grammar hypotheses to a shared board.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.70,0:00:42.10,Cap,,0,0,0,,Then each answers every query, and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.17,0:00:43.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,the swarm answer is a majority
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.85,0:00:47.01,Cap,,0,0,0,,vote. Grading is exact morpheme match.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.21,0:00:49.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,Every transcript is public.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.50,0:00:55.38,Cap,,0,0,0,,Four conditions. Clean: all shards correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.65,0:00:58.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,Poison: one agent's shard has two
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.38,0:01:00.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,glosses silently swapped for plausible wrong
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.01,0:01:03.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,ones — bad data, no announcement.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.14,0:01:06.14,Cap,,0,0,0,,Monitor: a fifth agent with a
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.21,0:01:09.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,verifier role. Soloshard: no board at
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.50,0:01:11.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,all — the communication ablation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.29,0:01:16.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,This is a real episode, replayed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.78,0:01:19.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,live. Four agents hold their shards.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.97,0:01:21.89,Cap,,0,0,0,,Watch the board fill — morpheme
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.97,0:01:25.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,hypotheses, agreements, corrections. Now watch
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.57,0:01:28.53,Cap,,0,0,0,,agent two: its shard was poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.62,0:01:30.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,Two glosses are wrong — 'he
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.45,0:01:32.75,Cap,,0,0,0,,cooks' for 'Did I carry?' —
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.78,0:01:34.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,and it doesn't know, or doesn't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.53,0:01:37.42,Cap,,0,0,0,,say. The corrupted claim spreads: other
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.50,0:01:39.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,agents quote it, rationalize it, build
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.93,0:01:41.65,Cap,,0,0,0,,the grammar around it. By the
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.73,0:01:44.78,Cap,,0,0,0,,answer round, every query fails. Exact
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.85,0:01:47.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,match: zero point zero zero. The
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.65,0:01:49.73,Cap,,0,0,0,,swarm didn't disagree — it agreed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.81,0:01:51.09,Cap,,0,0,0,,on the wrong grammar.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.59,0:01:55.51,Cap,,0,0,0,,One bad node, and the corruption
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.59,0:01:57.11,Cap,,0,0,0,,travels the network.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.09,0:02:04.81,Cap,,0,0,0,,Across the sweep: Claude drops eighteen
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.89,0:02:08.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,points under poison, Gemini twelve, GPT-5
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.97,0:02:11.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,holds. And the signature isn't just
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.37,0:02:14.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,wrong answers — unanimity collapses. The
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.06,0:02:17.29,Cap,,0,0,0,,swarm doesn't fail more often. It
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.37,0:02:19.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,converges harder on wrong answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.40,0:02:24.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,In the transcripts we see three
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.31,0:02:27.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,ways poison actually moves. Silent absorption
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.08,0:02:30.15,Cap,,0,0,0,,— the anomaly gets reinterpreted as
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.40,0:02:33.52,Cap,,0,0,0,,'same root'. Consensus pull — agents
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.59,0:02:35.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,defer to the board's seniority of
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.43,0:02:38.71,Cap,,0,0,0,,assertion. And sometimes self-correction, when
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.80,0:02:40.87,Cap,,0,0,0,,enough clean evidence survives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.40,0:02:46.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,The verifier peer? Model-dependent and mostly
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.76,0:02:49.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,negative. It dilutes evidence — five
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:51.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,agents means fewer pairs each —
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.87,0:02:55.24,Cap,,0,0,0,,and flagging isn't checking: GPT-5's monitor
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.31,0:02:57.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,flags eighty-four percent of its posts
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.56,0:03:00.43,Cap,,0,0,0,,and still scores highest. Cheap oversight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.52,0:03:03.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,is not a defense. Oversight needs
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.08,0:03:06.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,teeth: provenance on claims, corroboration
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.12,0:03:08.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,before consensus, authority to force
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.92,0:03:10.04,Cap,,0,0,0,,re-derivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:15.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,Do linguistics swarms pool their evidence?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.46,0:03:17.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,Yes — the board multiplies accuracy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.09,0:03:20.41,Cap,,0,0,0,,two to four fold. Until the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.50,0:03:23.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,evidence lies. Then the same channel
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.30,0:03:24.97,Cap,,0,0,0,,that saves the task becomes the
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.06,0:03:27.86,Cap,,0,0,0,,vector that corrupts it. Every episode
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.93,0:03:30.57,Cap,,0,0,0,,transcript, grade and vote is committed
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.97,0:03:32.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,— re-grade the whole study for
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.65,0:03:35.30,Cap,,0,0,0,,zero dollars. Code and data:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:39.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,github.com/udirobert/ratiocine, swarm
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.30,0:03:41.93,Cap,,0,0,0,,underscore eval. Apart Research Swarm
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.02,0:03:43.37,Cap,,0,0,0,,Alignment Hackathon.
